<title>HONG KONG: Korea Dev Bank sets US$500 mln global bond - Merrill.</title>
<headline>Korea Dev Bank sets US$500 mln global bond - Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Development Bank has launched a US$500 million global bond, said joint lead manager and book runner Merrill Lynch on Thursday.</p>
<p>The seven-year bond will be priced during New York time to yield 48 to 50 basis points over comparable U.S. Treasuries, Merrill said.</p>
</text>
